{"id":"29ee7a5caab12d22","group":"20","path":"20/20-prop-mred-complements.md","title":"归约与取补的兼容性","display":"prop-mred-complements — 归约与取补的兼容性","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-prop-mred-complements","aliases":["20-prop-mred-complements"],"display":"prop-mred-complements — 归约与取补的兼容性","chapter":"1","section":"1.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Definition 1.6.8 后的性质","source_printed_pages":[14],"source_pdf_pages":[50],"depends_on":["[[20-df-mred]]","[[20-df-one-reduction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-prop-mred-complements"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-prop-mred-complements</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-mred-complements — 归约与取补的兼容性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 1.6.8 后的性质"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>50</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f15de2c66c6318e\" href=\"?note=1f15de2c66c6318e\" title=\"20-df-one-reduction\">20-df-one-reduction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\{m,1\\}\">\\(r\\in\\{m,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline A=\\omega\\setminus A\">\\(\\overline A=\\omega\\setminus A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline B=\\omega\\setminus B\">\\(\\overline B=\\omega\\setminus B\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1f15de2c66c6318e\" href=\"?note=1f15de2c66c6318e\" title=\"20-df-one-reduction\">20-df-one-reduction</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}mred\\text{-}complements}\\vdash\nA\\le_r B\\Longleftrightarrow\\overline A\\le_r\\overline B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}mred\\text{-}complements}\\vdash\nA\\le_r B\\Longleftrightarrow\\overline A\\le_r\\overline B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同一个见证 f 满足 x∈A 当且仅当 f(x)∈B，取否定即得到两补集的归约；单射性不受影响。再次取补给逆向。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 1.6.8 后的性质；印刷页 14；PDF 第 50 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-mred]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-one-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"1f15de2c66c6318e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-one-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mred]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-one-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"1f15de2c66c6318e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mred]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\{m,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline A=\\omega\\setminus A","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline B=\\omega\\setminus B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}mred\\text{-}complements}\\vdash\nA\\le_r B\\Longleftrightarrow\\overline A\\le_r\\overline B.","display":true}],"bytes":1147,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-prop-mred-complements]] — 章 1；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-prop-mred-complements]]"}],"outgoing":["d5dada982b721c80","1f15de2c66c6318e"]}